            <note corresp="#d474-f4" n="4" xml:id="d474-f4-content">
                <p>This option is checked and a handwritten note reads: “Check with me and lets
                    follow his ideas in our message. L.” Bundy’s handwritten notation at the bottom
                    of the source text reads: “I’m against a message from you to Smith. And if you
                    prefer we can answer Wilson on the Rusk-Stewart channel. But on substance I
                    agree. Mac.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d474-f5" n="5" xml:id="d474-f5-content">
                <p> Bundy initialed below Komer’s signature.</p>
            </note>
